<title>MALAYSIA: Esso Malaysia 6-mth net up 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Esso Malaysia 6-mth net up 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>	     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Oper net profit	37.91	  vs	 29.49</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    14.0	   vs	 11.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,008.00	vs     822.70</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  49.02	vs	17.95</p>
<p>    Minorities		 nil	 vs	 nil</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  nil	 vs	 nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	10.0	 vs	10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Esso Malaysia Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
